            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"A run of tildes pairs only with a closer of its own length, one or two, and a run directly after an escaped tilde may open or close.\\n\\nPlain \\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126; text.\\n\\nPlain \\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126; text.\\n\\nPlain ~~\\u0026#126;~~ end.\\n\\nPlain ~~a~~ text.\\n\\nPlain ~~a~~ text.\\n\\n~~a \\u0026#126;b~~ c\\u0026#126;\\n\\n~~a b~~ c\\n\\n~~a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;b~~\\n\\n~~a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126; \\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;b~~\\n\\n~~a~~~\\n\\nb ~~~a~~~\\n\\n| h |\\n| --- |\\n| \\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126; |\\n\\n# \\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;\\n\\n[\\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;](u)\\n\\n![\\\\~a\\\\~\\\\~](u)\\n\\n[~~\\u0026#126;~~](u)\\n\\n\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;\\n\\na\\u0026#126;~~b~~\\n\\n\\\\~~~~\\n\\nx ~~\\u0026#126;~~ y ~~\\u0026#126;~~\\n\\n\\\\\\\\~~a~~\\n\\n\\\\\\\\\\u0026#126;~~a~~\\n\\n\\\\\\\\\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;\\n\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\~~a~~\\n\\n\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;a\\u0026#126;\\u0026#126;\\n\\n\\u0026#126;~~a~~ b\\n\\n| h |\\n| --- |\\n| ~~\\u0026#126;~~ |\\n\",\"markdown_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A run of tildes pairs only with a closer of its own length, one or two, and a run directly after an escaped tilde may open or close.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Plain ~a~~ text.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Plain ~~a~ text.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Plain \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"~\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strike_through\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" end.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Plain \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"a\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"strike_through\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" text.\"}]},{\"type\":